# Optional — /api/packet drafts each cluster's sentence with a model when
# this is set. Without it, the route falls back to deterministic,
# template-built sentences over the exact same cited events: the firewall
# (no source link, no sentence) holds either way, so a missing key degrades
# the prose, never the guarantee.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_CHAT_MODEL=
